                                "sense_id": "ad1cc7ba-efc1-3c7d-be75-c21582da85ca",
                                "text": "I flipped from the calendar app to the email app and logged in to view Cooper's. The unreads were staggering; I'd have to triage them later."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3766828b-775e-4b0d-9612-ad1fdfe9e9b2",
                                "sense_id": "ad1cc7ba-efc1-3c7d-be75-c21582da85ca",
                                "text": "You will have fewer 'Unreads' staring at you from your Inbox, and will feel—and be—more productive."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
